category: Math
requires: bash cygwin libgcc1 libjags5 libltdl7 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Just Another Gibbs Sampler (utilities)"
ldesc: "JAGS is Just Another Gibbs Sampler. It is a program for analysis of Bayesian
hierarchical models using Markov Chain Monte Carlo (MCMC) simulation not
wholly unlike BUGS."

